00:00:39.013 --> 00:00:42.550
HAVE THE TEMPERAMENT TO BE A

00:00:41.182 --> 00:00:44.351
SUPREME COURT JUSTICE.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.753
&gt;&gt; FELT LIKE OH, THAT IS WHAT

00:00:44.485 --> 00:00:47.655
