00:00:51.692 --> 00:00:58.399
BECAUSE OF TEMPERAMENT AND

00:00:55.062 --> 00:00:58.766
FITNESS, WHICH I BELIEVE HE

00:00:58.533 --> 00:01:00.802
LACKS.

00:00:58.966 --> 00:01:01.903
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SENATOR

00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:02.537
BLUMENTHAL DELIVERING HIS

00:01:02.036 --> 00:01:04.138
VERDICT HERE.

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:06.674
CHRIS HAHN AN ATTORNEY AND

00:01:04.272 --> 00:01:07.709
RADIO HOST AND FORMER AIDE TO

00:01:06.808 --> 00:01:08.376
SENATOR CHUCK SCHUMER AND HE

00:01:07.842 --> 00:01:10.111
JOINS US TONIGHT.

00:01:08.509 --> 00:01:10.945
THIS IS THE MOST OR WELLIAN

00:01:10.244 --> 00:01:13.414
ARGUMENT I HAVE SEEN.

00:01:11.079 --> 00:01:14.582
YOU ATTACK A GUY, AN ATTEMPTED

00:01:13.548 --> 00:01:14.949
RAPIST AND A DRUNK, SOMEONE

00:01:14.716 --> 00:01:16.384
UNFIT.

00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:17.485
