00:01:21.289 --> 00:01:24.292
LOOK AT HIM.

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:24.692
HE IS AN ABUSER BECAUSE HE GOT

00:01:24.425 --> 00:01:25.226
MAD.

00:01:24.826 --> 00:01:28.396
WHAT?

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:30.398
THAT IS TOO UNFAIR, ACTUALLY.

00:01:28.596 --> 00:01:34.602
&gt;&gt; WELL, WHEN YOU ARE WEAK ON

00:01:30.531 --> 00:01:35.336
THE LAW, -- WEAK ON THE FACTS,

00:01:34.736 --> 00:01:40.441
POUND THE LAW.

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:41.876
IF YOU ARE WALK ON THE LAW,

00:01:40.575 --> 00:01:43.344
POUND THE FACTS.

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:45.413
IF YOU ARE WEAK ON BOTH, YOU

00:01:43.478 --> 00:01:49.150
POUND THE TABLE.

00:01:45.546 --> 00:01:50.552
IT WAS A DISAPPOINTING DISPLAY

00:01:49.284 --> 00:01:50.985
BY JUDGE KAVANAUGH, JUDGE

00:01:50.685 --> 00:01:52.453
WOULD ACCEPT.

00:01:51.119 --> 00:01:53.388
I WORKED IN THE FEDERAL COURTS

00:01:52.587 --> 00:01:53.922
AND I WORKED IN THE STATE

00:01:53.521 --> 00:01:55.056
COURTS.

00:01:54.055 --> 00:01:55.623
