00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:58.092
LIKE THAT.

00:01:55.757 --> 00:01:59.594
THAT IS NOT SOMETHING YOU

00:01:58.226 --> 00:01:59.961
ACCEPT FROM A LEVEL-HEADED

00:01:59.727 --> 00:02:00.662
